Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:24.95,Speaker_S02,,0,0,0,,S02: 接上他的腿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.32,Speaker_S04,,0,0,0,,S04: 大哥这他妈是惊喜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:30.32,Speaker_S04,,0,0,0,,S04: 小弟我愿意等你三天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.35,0:02:30.88,Speaker_S01,,0,0,0,,S01: 好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:34.68,Speaker_S04,,0,0,0,,S04: 黄老爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:37.75,Speaker_S04,,0,0,0,,S04: 汤师爷是我的挚爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:40.92,Speaker_S04,,0,0,0,,S04: 你可不能夺我所爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.75,Speaker_S01,,0,0,0,,S01: 了然
